<title>SPAIN: Vallehermoso H1 attributable rises 18 pct.</title>
<headline>Vallehermoso H1 attributable rises 18 pct.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-07-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results for Spain's Vallehermoso for the first six months of 1997.</p>
<p>In billions of pesetas, unless stated:</p>
<p> Net attributable			  3.03   up 18 pct</p>
<p> Turnover				   22.55   up 1.7 pct</p>
<p>Rents					  3.63   up    16 pct</p>
<p>Services				     0.98   up    6.7 pct</p>
<p>Product sales			    17.94   down  1.0 pct</p>
<p>Sales contracted			   n/a    up   63.0 pct</p>
<p>Cash flow				    3.44   up   36.4 pct</p>
<p>NOTE - Vallehermoso reduced its financial debt by 5.5 billion pesetas compared to December 31, 1996.</p>
<p>&quot;The future outlook has improved notably for the year thanks to the clear and sustained recovery of the overall economy,&quot; Vallehermoso said in a statement.</p>
<p>-- Madrid Newsroom +34 1 585-2160</p>
</text>
